Samples for DOCXClass.prg

  DOCXWriter.prg   - title, table of contents, headings, formatted text, lists, tables, pictures, link, header/footer -> sample.docx
  DOCXTemplate.prg - creates template.docx with {{placeholders}} and fills it -> invoice.docx
  DOCXReader.prg   - reads paragraphs and tables (default invoice.docx, or: docxreader sample.docx)

Build:
  hbmk2 docxwriter.hbp
  hbmk2 docxtemplate.hbp
  hbmk2 docxreader.hbp
